Text Notes 800 10100 0 75 ~ 0
OUT1=L only after 1.5-A/3-A advertisement is detected: U11 turns on. Default USB remains OFF.
Text Notes 800 10400 0 75 ~ 0
M1 compensates for cable/switch voltage drops: nominal 5 V, +/-3%. Verify 4.75...5.25 V at TIA.
Text Notes 800 10700 0 75 ~ 0
C1+C4 directly at VBUS; larger reservoirs after U11 only. No protection against arbitrary USB fault voltages.
$EndSCHEMATC
